 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "Ravi and Priya are serving soup and salad along with the main course at their wedding reception. The reception will have a total of 150 guests in attendance. A total of 92 soups and 85 salads were ordered, while 23 guests did not order any soup or salad.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 495124,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How many guests had soup or salad or both?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>127</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Total number of guests = 150</p>\n<p><i>n</i>(neither soup nor salad) = 23</p>\n<p>To find the number who had soup, salad, or both, subtract 23 from 150.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"150 - 23 = 127\"></span></p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 495125,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How many guests had both soup and a salad?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p>50</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Total number of guests = 150</p>\n<p><i>n</i>(neither soup nor salad) = 23</p>\n<p>To find the number who had soup, salad, or both, subtract 23 from 150.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"150 - 23 = 127\"></span></p>\n<p>This represents the number of elements in the union of the sets of Soup and Salad eaters.</p>\n<p><i>n</i>(Soup <span data-math=\"\\cup\"></span> Salad) = 127</p>\n<p><i>n</i> (Soup) = 92</p>\n<p><i>n</i> (Salad) = 85</p>\n<p>Use the formula: <span data-math=\"n\\left( {A \\cup B} \\right) = n(A) + n(B) - n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Substitute.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"127 = 92 + 85 - n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"127 = 177 - n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Subtract 127.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"127 - 127 = 177 - n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right) - 127\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"0 = 50 - n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Add the variable.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"0 + n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right) = 50 - n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right) + n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right)\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"n\\left( {A \\cap B} \\right) = 50\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
